    "sec15.p1": "If a provision is invalid, the remaining provisions continue. A delay in enforcement is not a waiver. Changes must be recorded in writing. The service schedule, Payment Agreement, Privacy Notice, Media Consent Form and Profile Sharing Agreement form part of the overall agreement where applicable.",

